dial-ghostty third-party notices
================================

dial statically links libghostty-vt, built from third_party/ghostty at commit
b40acce58dcf77df52231c3798ea58e924647c89. The archive contains the code listed
below. cargo-deny cannot see any of it, so this file is the record, and a
shipped dial binary must reproduce these notices (e.g. in an About/licenses view).
Check this list again whenever the pin is bumped (`ar -t` on the built archive
shows its members).

Archive members at this pin: vt, libghostty-vt-static_zcu (Ghostty, Zig std),
compiler_rt (Zig), simdutf, base64/codepoint_width/index_of (Ghostty SIMD glue),
libhighway_zcu/per_target/targets/abort (Highway), wuffs-v0.4 (Wuffs), plus the
Unicode tables Ghostty generates with uucode.

